{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1088829-rank-this-gift","id":1088829,"title":"Rank this Gift","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-05-06T13:26:15-07:00","id":1088829,"title":"Rank this Gift","content":"There is a Rank 6 Ragabash Gift where you can get zapped by another being's power (Fire Bringer?) and you create a Gift based on that power. If a Mage were able to transfer a Prime 4, Spirit 3 Rote that allowed you to &quot;burn&quot; down the Gauntlet what level Gift would that be?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","name":"Mercurial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar986_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-06T14:05:13-07:00","id":1088840,"title":"","content":"Since you didn't specify the effect overly much, and looking at the Spheres involved, it looks like an effect that would allow you to make a lasting, if not permanent, reduction to the Gauntlet. For Garou, this would be a higher-rank Gift, whereas for Corax and Nuwisha (and presumably also Camazotz if they were still alive), it would be more of a mid-ranked thing. There's not really a guideline for this; the power is not really material to it, and theoretically some higher-ranked effects in Mage might end up as starting Gifts for some changers. Changing your blood into a virulent toxin that injures anyone taking a bite is really difficult for Garou, but Rokea? Rank Two. Feline agility? Takes some time for wolves, but the cats, naturally, have it right from the beginning.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-06T18:13:52-07:00","id":1088928,"title":"","content":"Yea, for me this will really depend on the system involved. Just stating Spheres/effect doesn't really explain the power as a Gift.<br /> <br /> Also, if you plan on getting the Gift via Firebringer, this doesn't actually sound like it will work. For Firebringer to work, the power as to actually be used on the Garou in question. But you can still invent this Gift either way.<br /> <br /> So what does it do exactly? Does it lower the Gauntlet? Does it punch a hole in it? How long does it last? A Scene? Permanent?<br /> (again, for me) Answering those will make it easier to judge a Rank level for the Gift. And as Saur stated, Gifts for different Fera can be completely different Ranks. Something like this will come much easier to Nuwisha than to Garou.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://drive.google.com/uc?export=view&amp;id=0B9RzepSqCby3Mi1KUmJ5aWUwRVk\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/805-idpersona","name":"idpersona","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar805_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2117"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-07T00:46:08-07:00","id":1089036,"title":"","content":"One of the problems with Fire Bringer, a lot of powers worth stealing, arent really &quot;weaponized&quot; powers.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-07T06:38:15-07:00","id":1089104,"title":"","content":"All good questions. The way I figure it. The Mage can localize something as the target and the fire spreads from it. I envision spending 5 Gnosis, rolling your Permanent Gnosis and letting the Gauntlet drop by one for every success by a yard for every success. The effects will be slowly reversed over a period of days provided that the area is left alone by those wielding this Gift.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","name":"Mercurial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar986_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-07T08:55:42-07:00","id":1089191,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mercurial</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1088829-rank-this-gift?p=1089104#post1089104\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">All good questions. The way I figure it. The Mage can localize something as the target and the fire spreads from it. I envision spending 5 Gnosis, rolling your Permanent Gnosis and letting the Gauntlet drop by one for every success by a yard for every success. The effects will be slowly reversed over a period of days provided that the area is left alone by those wielding this Gift.</div> </div> </div> </div>Okay. So some critiques on that system: That kind of cost means it can only be a Rank 5-6 Gift. Lower Rank Gifts just don't have that heavy of costs (generally speaking). And the system then seems not to keep up with the proposed (to me) Rank of the Gift.<br /> <br /> Maybe something like: Lower the Gauntlet for each Gnosis spent. If the Gauntlet reaches 0, tear an actual hole through that anyone can pass through. The Gauntlet will reassert itself at 1 point per day. And if you spend Gnosis in excess of reaching zero, that extends the time frame of the tear by 12 hours (or a day) per. Rank 6 for Garou. Rank 5 for Nuwisha/Ananasi (maybe Corax). Not attainable by Fera without affinity for the Gauntlet/Umbra (Bastet/Mokole/Rokea for sure).<br /> <br /> And Firebringer won't be the reason for this coming into existence. But there is no reason it can be a newly invented/rediscovered Gift though.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://drive.google.com/uc?export=view&amp;id=0B9RzepSqCby3Mi1KUmJ5aWUwRVk\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/805-idpersona","name":"idpersona","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar805_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2117"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-07T09:26:05-07:00","id":1089206,"title":"","content":"Couldn't Firebringer be the cause if the Rote starts out by targeting someone or something and causes the effect to spread out from there.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","name":"Mercurial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar986_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-07T13:23:46-07:00","id":1089341,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mercurial</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1088829-rank-this-gift?p=1089206#post1089206\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Couldn't Firebringer be the cause if the Rote starts out by targeting someone or something and causes the effect to spread out from there.</div> </div> </div> </div>Maybe. Though the effect doesn't seem to have much to do with the target. It's a 6th Rank Gift though, so I could see affording it a lot of leeway.<br /> <br /> In the end it'd be a ST decision, but I would lean heavily towards no.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://drive.google.com/uc?export=view&amp;id=0B9RzepSqCby3Mi1KUmJ5aWUwRVk\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":805,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/805-idpersona","user":"idpersona","date":". 05-07-2017, 04:32 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/805-idpersona","name":"idpersona","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar805_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2117"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}